# An allowlist: only what the image is built from reaches the build, so
# .env, .git, tests, the acceptance suite, the docs and the skills never do,
# whatever is added to the repo later.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/*/README.md
!packages/*/src/

# Caches, inside what is allowed
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
